  "description": "Hand-written free-text searches, the way an on-call engineer would type them. 'expected' is the root_cause a good answer is about; 'also' (optional) lists other root causes that are just as right when the query is ambiguous (a bare ECONNREFUSED is logged by both the cache and the database clients). 'kind': keyword = an exact token that appears in the logs; paraphrase = describes the problem without the logs' words; mixed = shares some words.",
